Notes that travel with the license:

- Every factual field derives from the public source cited on that field.
  The underlying filings and press releases remain the property and
  responsibility of their publishers; this license covers the extracted,
  structured dataset and its annotations, not the source documents.
- Scores are the mechanical output of the rubric in ../../METHODOLOGY.md
  applied to those sources, frozen as of July 2026. If you redistribute the
  data, keep the date stamps: an undated score is a different, stronger, and
  unsupported claim.
- Nothing in this dataset is investment advice, and no listed company or
  vendor has paid to appear or to change anything.

